Q01 최근 한 달 실제 총매출 [before]

SQL
SELECT
            sum(oi.line_total) AS total_revenue
        FROM ecom.orders o
        JOIN ecom.order_items oi
          ON oi.order_id = o.order_id
        WHERE o.order_status IN ('paid', 'shipped', 'delivered')
          AND o.order_ts >= now() - interval '1 month'

RESULT (22.45 ms)
total_revenue
-------------
2063896.36   
total rows: 1